<div class="page">
    <div class="section-title">Concordia University, St Paul</div>
    <p>Provider: <span data-field="provider.name">{{ provider.name }}</span></p>
    <p>Eligibility: <span data-field="eligibility.description">{{ eligibility.description }}</span></p>
    <p>A tuition remission of <span data-field="tuition_remission_percentage">{{ tuition_remission_percentage }}</span> for Bachelors/Masters/Doctoral programs is available for eligible employees. In addition, employee's spouses are eligible for <span data-field="spouse_remission_percentage">{{ spouse_remission_percentage }}</span> tuition remission, both for a singular bachelor's degree program only. Eligible employees, spouses, and dependents are able to enroll in colleges or universities that participate in the Council of Independent Colleges (CIC) and through the Tuition Exchange Program (TEP). If there is interest in CIC or TEP, please contact <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>. Employees and/or dependents attending Concordia University must submit a completed tuition waiver form to Human Resources in advance of beginning classes each semester or they will be required to pay tuition for that term.</p>

    <div class="section-title">Additional University Benefits</div>
